Description: status/keyboard: Read the layout variant of IBus engines
 InputSource._getXkbId() reads engineDesc.variant, which IBus.EngineDesc does
 not have: its property is layout-variant (layout_variant in GJS). The check
 is always false, so an IBus engine declaring layout "us" and variant
 "alt-intl" got the plain "us" keymap, without its dead keys and AltGr level.
 .
 Read layout_variant.
Author: Maxime Allanic
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-10-19
---
 js/ui/status/keyboard.js |    4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

--- a/js/ui/status/keyboard.js
+++ b/js/ui/status/keyboard.js
@@ -68,8 +68,8 @@
         if (!engineDesc)
             return this.id;
 
-        if (engineDesc.variant && engineDesc.variant.length > 0)
-            return `${engineDesc.layout}+${engineDesc.variant}`;
+        if (engineDesc.layout_variant && engineDesc.layout_variant.length > 0)
+            return `${engineDesc.layout}+${engineDesc.layout_variant}`;
         else
             return engineDesc.layout;
     }
